//    near Spartak and Tsarska Okhota taken ~20 Jan; north-eastern breach 2–9 Feb; supply road cut and Lastochkyne
//    crossroads reached 14–15 Feb; Zenit abandoned 14–15 Feb; withdrawal 17 Feb; Lastochkyne, Stepove, Sieverne by 27 Feb.
//  - ISW, Russian Offensive Campaign Assessment, 11 Oct 2023 — the attack axes and settlements named.
